{"meta":{"id":"generic","category":"it/syntax/java/function","title":"제네릭 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"제네릭 클래스 · 메서드, extends 제약, 와일드카드 ?, 타입 소거","tags":["java","f-generic"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">제네릭 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 제네릭 클래스 · 메서드, extends 제약, 와일드카드 ?, 타입 소거</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제네릭</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public class Box&lt;T&gt; {\r\n    private T value;\r\n    public Box(T value) { this.value = value; }\r\n    public T get() { return value; }\r\n}\r\n\r\npublic static &lt;T&gt; T first(List&lt;T&gt; list) {\r\n    return list.isEmpty() ? null : list.get(0);\r\n}\r\n\r\n// 제약 (extends) · 와일드카드\r\npublic static &lt;T extends Comparable&lt;T&gt;&gt; T max(List&lt;T&gt; list) { ... }\r\ndouble total(List&lt;? extends Number&gt; nums) { ... }   // Number 의 하위 타입 아무거나</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">컴파일 후 타입 정보가 지워진다(타입 소거) — 실행 중 List&lt;String&gt; 과 List&lt;Integer&gt; 구분 불가</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 변수 이름 관례</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">이름</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;T&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Type — 임의의 참조형 타입</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;E&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Element — 요소</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;K&gt; / &lt;V&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Key / Value</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;N&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Number — 숫자</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;S, U, V&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">두 번째, 세 번째, 네 번째 타입</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">extends · super 범위</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class GenericA&lt;T, E, K extends Number&gt; {\r\n    T name1;\r\n    E name2;\r\n    // static T NAME3;       // 오류: 클래스 타입 변수는 static 에 사용 불가\r\n    // T name3 = &quot;A&quot;;        // 오류: T 가 무엇인지 모르므로 값 대입 불가\r\n\r\n    T echo(T value) { return value; }\r\n}\r\n\r\nnew GenericA&lt;String, Integer, Double&gt;();   // K 는 Number 의 자식만 (Integer, Double, Long …)\r\n\r\n// A extends B, B extends D, D extends E 일 때\r\nList&lt;? extends D&gt; a;   // D 와 그 자식 (A, B, D)\r\nList&lt;? super D&gt; b;     // D 와 그 부모 (D, E)</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>K extends 타입</code> — 그 타입을 상속받은 <strong>자식 타입만</strong> 사용 가능 (상한)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>? super 타입</code> — 그 타입과 <strong>부모 타입만</strong> 사용 가능 (하한)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">클래스를 만들 때 타입을 지정하지 않으면 Object 로 처리된다(raw type)</span></div></div></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 제네릭, Java › 컴파일 시점 검사</p>","path":"it/syntax/java/function/generic","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"function","title":"함수","path":"it/syntax/java/function"}],"hasImage":false}